+    is a (patch, coordinates) pair, where the coordinates are an integer array with one row per dimension, including
+    the channel, giving the start and stop of that dimension in the original image.
+
+    For example, for single-channel 2D images of shape (1, 4, 4) a patch size of (2, 2) gives patches of shape
+    (1, 2, 2) and coordinates of shape (3, 2), with rows for the channel, dimension 1 and dimension 2:
+
